      "locale": "en_US",
      "tier": "tooltip",
      "text": "Rammus enters a defensive formation for 7 seconds, gaining (35.1/44/53.65/64.05/75.2 + (30/37.5/45/52.5/60% Armor)) Armor and (26/34.375/43.5/53.375/64 + (30/37.5/45/52.5/60% Magic Resist)) Magic Resist and dealing (15 + (10% Armor) + (10% Magic Resist)) magic damage to enemies that Attack him. Recast: Rammus ends this Ability early.",
      "variant": null
    },
